  ["item.explorer-s-pack.xphb2024"]={title="Explorer's Pack",subtitle="Item - XPHB - 2024",body="Pagina: 225\n\nRaridade: none\n\nAn Explorer's Pack contains the following items: XPHB, XPHB, 2 flasks of XPHB, 10 days of XPHB, XPHB, XPHB, 10 XPHB, and XPHB."},
  ["feature.explosive-cannon.efa2014.artificer.artillerist.9"]={title="Explosive Cannon",subtitle="Caracteristica - EFA - 2014",body="Pagina: 17\n\nEvery EFA you create is now more destructive. You gain the following benefits.\n\nDetonate\n\nWhen your cannon takes damage, you can take a XPHB to command the cannon to detonate if you are within 60 feet of it. Doing so destroys the cannon and forces each creature within 20 feet of it to make a Dexterity saving throw against your spell save DC, taking 3d10 Force damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\n\nFirepower\n\nThe cannon's damage rolls and the number of XPHB granted by Protector increase by 1d8."},
  ["feature.explosive-cannon.tce2014.artificer.artillerist.9"]={title="Explosive Cannon",subtitle="Caracteristica - TCE - 2014",body="Pagina: 17\n\nStarting at 9th level, every eldritch cannon you create is more destructive:\n\n• The cannon's damage rolls all increase by 1d8.\n\n• As an action, you can command the cannon to detonate if you are within 60 feet of it. Doing so destroys the cannon and forces each creature within 20 feet of it to make a Dexterity saving throw against your spell save DC, taking 3d8 force damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one."},
  ["item.explosive-seed.egw2014"]={title="Explosive Seed",subtitle="Item - EGW - 2014",body="Pagina: 225\n\nRaridade: none\n\nThis acorn-sized sphere of brass contains a small amount of blasting powder and a clockwork trigger. An explosive seed can be thrown up to 30 feet as an action, detonating on impact. Each creature within 5 feet of the exploding seed must make a 10 Dexterity saving throw, taking 1d8 bludgeoning damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one."},
  ["optionalfeature.extended-spell.phb2014"]={title="Extended Spell",subtitle="Opcao/Feature - PHB - 2014",body="Pagina: 102\n\nWhen you cast a spell that has a duration of 1 minute or longer, you can spend 1 sorcery point to double its duration, to a maximum duration of 24 hours."},
  ["optionalfeature.extended-spell.xphb2024"]={title="Extended Spell",subtitle="Opcao/Feature - XPHB - 2024",body="Pagina: 142\n\nWhen you cast a spell that has a duration of 1 minute or longer, you can spend 1 Sorcery Point to double its duration to a maximum duration of 24 hours.\n\nIf the affected spell requires XPHB, you have XPHB on any saving throw you make to maintain that XPHB."},
  ["feature.extra-attack.efa2014.artificer.armorer.5"]={title="Extra Attack",subtitle="Caracteristica - EFA - 2014",body="Pagina: 15\n\nYou can attack twice instead of once whenever you take the XPHB action on your turn."},
  ["feature.extra-attack.efa2014.artificer.battle-smith.5"]={title="Extra Attack",subtitle="Caracteristica - EFA - 2014",body="Pagina: 19\n\nYou can attack twice instead of once whenever you take the XPHB action on your turn. You can forgo one of your attacks when you take the XPHB action to command your EFA to take the Force-Empowered Rend action."},
  ["feature.extra-attack.frhof2014.wizard.bladesinger.6"]={title="Extra Attack",subtitle="Caracteristica - FRHoF - 2014",body="Pagina: 27\n\nYou can attack twice, instead of once, whenever you take the XPHB action on your turn. Moreover, you can cast spells in place of one of those attacks."},
  ["feature.extra-attack.phb2014.barbarian.base.5"]={title="Extra Attack",subtitle="Caracteristica - PHB - 2014",body="Pagina: 46\n\nBeginning at 5th level, you can attack twice, instead of once, whenever you take the Attack action on your turn."},
  ["feature.extra-attack.phb2014.bard.valor.6"]={title="Extra Attack",subtitle="Caracteristica - PHB - 2014",body="Pagina: 55\n\nStarting at 6th level, you can attack twice, instead of once, whenever you take the Attack action on your turn."},
  ["feature.extra-attack.phb2014.fighter.base.5"]={title="Extra Attack",subtitle="Caracteristica - PHB - 2014",body="Pagina: 72\n\nBeginning at 5th level, you can attack twice, instead of once, whenever you take the Attack action on your turn.\n\nThe number of attacks increases to three when you reach 11th level in this class and to four when you reach 20th level in this class."},
  ["feature.extra-attack.phb2014.monk.base.5"]={title="Extra Attack",subtitle="Caracteristica - PHB - 2014",body="Pagina: 76\n\nBeginning at 5th level, you can attack twice, instead of once, whenever you take the Attack action on your turn."},
  ["feature.extra-attack.phb2014.paladin.base.5"]={title="Extra Attack",subtitle="Caracteristica - PHB - 2014",body="Pagina: 82\n\nBeginning at 5th level, you can attack twice, instead of once, whenever you take the Attack action on your turn."},
  ["feature.extra-attack.phb2014.ranger.base.5"]={title="Extra Attack",subtitle="Caracteristica - PHB - 2014",body="Pagina: 89\n\nBeginning at 5th level, you can attack twice, instead of once, whenever you take the Attack action on your turn."},
  ["feature.extra-attack.tce2014.artificer.armorer.5"]={title="Extra Attack",subtitle="Caracteristica - TCE - 2014",body="Pagina: 15\n\n5th-level Armorer feature\n\nYou can attack twice, rather than once, whenever you take the Attack action on your turn."},
  ["feature.extra-attack.tce2014.artificer.battle-smith.5"]={title="Extra Attack",subtitle="Caracteristica - TCE - 2014",body="Pagina: 18\n\nStarting at 5th level, you can attack twice, rather than once, whenever you take the Attack action on your turn."},
  ["feature.extra-attack.tce2014.warrior-sidekick.base.6"]={title="Extra Attack",subtitle="Caracteristica - TCE - 2014",body="Pagina: 146\n\n6th-level Warrior feature\n\nThe sidekick can attack twice, instead of once, whenever it takes the Attack action on its turn.\n\nThe number of attacks increases to three when the sidekick reaches 15th level.\n\nIf the sidekick has the Multiattack action, it can use Extra Attack or Multiattack on a turn, not both."},
  ["feature.extra-attack.tce2014.wizard.bladesinging.6"]={title="Extra Attack",subtitle="Caracteristica - TCE - 2014",body="Pagina: 76\n\nStarting at 6th level, you can attack twice, instead of once, whenever you take the Attack action on your turn. Moreover, you can cast one of your cantrips in place of one of those attacks."},
  ["feature.extra-attack.xge2024.bard.swords.6"]={title="Extra Attack",subtitle="Caracteristica - XGE - 2024",body="Pagina: 15\n\nStarting at 6th level, you can attack twice, instead of once, whenever you take the Attack action on your turn."},
